{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_037_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e6a4a1ba3fcce85563056ac5bf0b3958cd82e8cacbfff26058058d00a260bf3b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c8f58afdf96a977179807877a57dc32eac56ab5b3650fb02e7bedc2561ecdce",
      "text": "还特意给我准备了情人节巧克力？\n多谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0a5472b7199b8782e1b1a253f9fbdbd824e17991a56c170238ec26c106f8166",
      "text": "哈哈，大叔我完全没料到居然能收到，\n稍微有点受宠若惊呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96dc4f470ca68d2b66f8d682c237b541e6966ed2c9b866b5584a9038d8b2f1e7",
      "text": "难得收到，我现在就吃掉吧。\n离碰头开会也还有点时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac2889e3d51c936cd2ba30e95c18bb77dba40ef4f5d4c9c83e6a2802ad8820a2",
      "text": "……哇哦。这巧克力真好吃啊。\n感觉有一股高级的味道呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a786b8bee85094cc78fb0d155f9098950138785df0219459de28136115839bd",
      "text": "这下白色情人节的回礼得好好努力了啊。\n嘛，适度地期待一下就好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_b:cmd-000009:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e221b1d90386e86f7f78bc8ee38b2d424a27f06c9d4c6c6733ea315b79e7d56",
      "text": "周到的礼物",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09dae74efec989c713dbc7758406bcec497ca37354b15cc0e5878af47845affb",
      "text": "辛苦啦……嗯？怎么啦，\n制作人酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1a437583055e612e295337fe106a4b0633c4e734c6939abc57c727da57a207a",
      "text": "这个是情人节巧克力？\n送给大叔我真的没关系吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e079507e237d223e6e6a6c815e7a25ce3e72faae05c172dba7176977be78c00",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱在这种事上\n还真是周到啊，或者说是做事很妥当呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:162c8d5248fb06eff7398226ea1d582f77dfc6c19e0c15ff2a3ab488de82085a",
      "text": "哎呀，真高兴啊。\n这下不考虑回礼不行了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_b:cmd-000043:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8814cc73f4a594da4889e0bd7ce16ab4e96758bc3dba3740737231fcee0d2ce",
      "text": "回礼不用客气也可以的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_b:cmd-000044:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05e584285bc79b3c9763f1924569887cdf080f40b82fb1fc10a1272f9335450a",
      "text": "请不要太放在心上",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8366df2d31c9a77d8ed50e16b957581732a41589b9d6101d587b1467c2c47a03",
      "text": "哎呀哎呀，别这么说嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5905f1561752b35cc05bf720b4665557a2ec3849afb9573bf5ff4570b0fcc57",
      "text": "受了●●●●プロデューサー酱这么多\n照顾却不回礼的话，可是会遭天谴的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61fe280dbd2380e87b38d3dd5c75f560ee11f9da7d4f581d0bffbc29f37abddf",
      "text": "嘛。不过毕竟是大叔我的品味，要是抱太大期待的话\n我可是会很伤脑筋的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_037_22:5_01_037_22_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57c846eb5f2df7cbc74efd7bd88f080e7d074bd835400ba4dca4f00547ce556e",
      "text": "不要抱有过度的期待，慢慢等吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
